    "PCB front and rear photographs preserve visible substrate appearance only; RF shield and radio-substrate marking use separate supported planes. UNKNOWN remains under the radio module and readable when radio parts are separated. Copper layers, component heights, exact connector CAD, SDIO and electrical behavior remain unverified."
